  "title": "Grandma Moyer&#39;s Rhubarb and Strawberry Coffee Cake",
  "description": "Grandma Moyer&#39;s rhubarb and strawberry coffee cake recipe actually contains coffee. This moist cake is studded with rhubarb and sliced strawberries.",
